# Task List
A to-do list:  add a task, check it off, filter the list, and edit the selected tasks together.
Its tasks are this project's own `<spell-view "task">`;  this file holds their list, and the app.
Where they're kept is the person's pick, "Keep them in":  each place is a keeper in an API file of its own,
TaskList.browser.api.spell, TaskList.server.api.spell, TaskList.csv.api.spell and TaskList.atmosphere.api.spell, all doing what TaskList.api.spell says.

## The checklist
The tasks, each its own element inside it:  `<task-list-checklist>`, around its `<task-list-task>`s.

<spell-view "checklist" template="viewable list of tasks">
	<property "showing" one-of="all, active or done"
		description="What it shows:  every task, the ones still to do, or the ones done"
		alias="is showing (showing)"
	/>

	<spell>
		// on the page, its tasks can be dragged to another place:  they move as the pointer does, gliding there
		- its items can be reordered immediately
		// each task, unless the filter hides it
		- to draw each item:
			if it is showing active and the task is done return nothing
			if it is showing done and the task is active return nothing
			return draw the task
	</spell>
	<draw description="Its tasks one under the other;  while it's empty, a line saying so">
		<stack spacing="xs">
			<if it is empty>
				<text color="grey">Nothing to do</text>
			</if>
			<children/>
		</stack>
	</draw>

	<test "the filter">
		set the tasks to a new checklist
		add (a new task with title = "a", done = yes) to the tasks
		add (a new task with title = "b") to the tasks
		the length of (tasks in the tasks where it is active) should be 1
	</test>
</spell-view>
<spell>
	// a task is in one checklist at a time
	a task belongs to one checklist
</spell>

## The app
Its toolbar, the new task's field, then the list beside the property editor.

<spell-app "task list">
	<property "checklist">a new checklist</>
	<property "draft" description="The next task's title, as the new task's field holds it">text</>
	<property "active count">the length of (tasks in the checklist where it is active)</>

	<group "keeping" description="Where the tasks are kept:  the person picks, and the app asks that keeper"/>
	<property "storage" one-of="browser, server, csv or atmosphere" description="Where the tasks are kept:  this browser, a JSON file on the server, a CSV file on the server, or your atmosphere account"/>
	<property "keeper" description="Who keeps them, for where they're kept:  one of the keepers in the API files">a task keeper</>

	<when its storage changes>
		if the storage is server
			set the keeper to a new server keeper
		otherwise if the storage is csv
			set the keeper to a new sheet keeper
		otherwise if the storage is atmosphere
			set the keeper to a new sky keeper
		otherwise
			set the keeper to a new browser keeper
		fill the checklist
	</>

	<action "fill the checklist" description="The keeper's tasks, in the list;  a keeper with none starts with a few">
		clear the checklist
		for task in the kept tasks of the keeper
			add it to the checklist
		if the checklist is not empty return
		add the starting task "Write the Task List example" with priority high
		add the starting task "Teach it to draw" with priority normal
		add the starting task "Select some tasks, then edit them together" with priority normal
		add the starting task "Drag tasks to reorder them" with priority low
		set the done of the first task in the checklist to yes
	</action>

	<action "create it" description="A new task list keeps its tasks in this browser, and shows every one">
		set the showing of the checklist to all
		set the storage to browser
		set the keeper to a new browser keeper
		fill the checklist
	</action>

	<action "add the starting task (title as text) with priority (level as text)">
		set task to keep a new task titled title of the keeper
		set the priority of task to level
		add task to the checklist
	</action>

	<action "add the draft" description="The draft, as a new task at the end of the list;  the field empties">
		if the draft is "" return
		set title to the draft
		set task to keep a new task titled title of the keeper
		set the priority of task to normal
		add task to the checklist
		clear the draft
	</action>

	<group "filter" description="Which tasks the list shows:  the toolbar ticks the one it's showing"/>
	<action "show all" title="All" icon="list" selected-when="the checklist is showing all">set the showing of the checklist to all</>
	<action "show to do" title="To do" icon="square outline" selected-when="the checklist is showing active">set the showing of the checklist to active</>
	<action "show done" title="Done" icon="check square outline" selected-when="the checklist is showing done">set the showing of the checklist to done</>
	<action "remove the done tasks" title="Remove the done tasks" icon="trash alternate outline">
		for task in (tasks in the checklist where it is done)
			throw the task away
			remove the task from the checklist
	</action>

	<group "menus" description="The toolbar's buttons, and the list's right click:  the same actions"/>
	<menu "tasks menu">
		<action "show all" />
		<action "show to do" />
		<action "show done" />
		<action "-" />
		<action "remove the done tasks" />
	</menu>
	<menu "show menu" title="Show">
		<action "show all" />
		<action "show to do" />
		<action "show done" />
	</menu>
	<menu "list menu" description="A right click on the list:  which tasks it shows, as a menu of its own, then tidying up">
		<menu "show menu" />
		<action "-" />
		<action "remove the done tasks" />
	</menu>

	<draw description="The property editor edits every selected task at once:  a property they disagree on shows Mixed">
		<container>
			<stack>
				<toolbar menu="tasks menu" aria-label="Tasks">
					<text slot="title" size="large">Task List</text>
					<text slot="right">
						<if the active count is 0>All done<otherwise>{the active count} to do</>
					</text>
				</toolbar>
				<form value={it}>
					<stack>
						<field label="Keep them in" inline>
							<select name="storage">
								<item value="browser" icon="desktop">This browser</item>
								<item value="server" icon="server">A JSON file on the server</item>
								<item value="csv" icon="table">A CSV file on the server</item>
								<item value="atmosphere" icon="cloud">Your atmosphere account</item>
							</select>
						</field>
						<input name="draft" placeholder="Something to do" aria-label="New task" fluid action>
							<button slot="action" color="primary" disabled={the draft is ""} onClick={add the draft}>Add</button>
						</input>
					</stack>
				</form>
				<grid columns="2" stackable context-menu="list menu">
					{draw the checklist}
					<ui-property-editor label="Selected tasks" schema="task-list-task" value={the selection of the checklist}>
						<ui-property name="title"/>
						<ui-property name="priority"/>
						<ui-property name="done"/>
						<ui-property name="notes"/>
					</ui-property-editor>
				</grid>
			</stack>
		</container>
	</draw>
</spell-app>
